{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A <strong>FRANTIC</strong> inventory-Management Auto-Battler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the meaty minds that brought you Hot Dogs, Horseshoes &amp; Hand Grenades, we are proud to present, <strong>Dunderbeck</strong>! That's right, it's <i>another sausage game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grind magical creatures into sausages in the mystical world of Cincinnati, Ohio!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So, what do I do in this game? <i>Huh?</i><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/GrindUp_Everything_O.gif?t=1746228370\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introducing the portable, all-purpose cooking &amp; crafting machine: Shove in carcasses and random junk; cook up things that might be edible, and cobble together basic tools and weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/Weaponize_Everything_O.gif?t=1746228370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seriously, pick something up and swing. A spoon? Sure. A lead pipe? Why not. A rat? Desperate times, right? Just don't expect your makeshift arsenal to last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/Consume_Everything_O.gif?t=1746228370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey, everything is eatable - at least once!  Hold any item in your mouth for too long, and down the hatch it goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/Organize_Everything_O.gif?t=1746228370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like the garbage you keep at home, all of <strong>OUR WONDERFUL GARBAGE</strong> has a size and shape. You can put it into nice little rows, or you can just go full goblin mode. We aren't your mom - do what <i>feels right</i>, you know?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2477750?t=1746228370","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2477750?t=1746228370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/4a48e28ec987591188e29b7863e261b2a98d5c57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746228370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/4a48e28ec987591188e29b7863e261b2a98d5c57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746228370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Cartoon depiction of dead magical creatures and food products prepared from their remains."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Hear Ye, Hear Ye!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upcoming Events where you can play <strong>Dunderbeck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">January 23-26 @ Super MAGFest</span></strong><span class=\"bb_strike\"> in Washington, D.C </span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>May 5-7 @ GodotCon</strong> in Boston </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>June 27-29 @ TooManyGames</strong> in Philadelphia </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A <strong>FRANTIC</strong> inventory-Management Auto-Battler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the meaty minds that brought you Hot Dogs, Horseshoes &amp; Hand Grenades, we are proud to present, <strong>Dunderbeck</strong>! That's right, it's <i>another sausage game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grind magical creatures into sausages in the mystical world of Cincinnati, Ohio!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">So, what do I do in this game? <i>Huh?</i><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/GrindUp_Everything_O.gif?t=1746228370\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introducing the portable, all-purpose cooking &amp; crafting machine: Shove in carcasses and random junk; cook up things that might be edible, and cobble together basic tools and weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/Weaponize_Everything_O.gif?t=1746228370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seriously, pick something up and swing. A spoon? Sure. A lead pipe? Why not. A rat? Desperate times, right? Just don't expect your makeshift arsenal to last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/Consume_Everything_O.gif?t=1746228370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey, everything is eatable - at least once!  Hold any item in your mouth for too long, and down the hatch it goes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/extras/Organize_Everything_O.gif?t=1746228370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like the garbage you keep at home, all of <strong>OUR WONDERFUL GARBAGE</strong> has a size and shape. You can put it into nice little rows, or you can just go full goblin mode. We aren't your mom - do what <i>feels right</i>, you know?</p>","developers":["RUST LTD."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/c577085ed215216e8138eaa77adeca480cd49ab6/header.jpg?t=1746228370","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 or newer</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257090956,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090956/movie480.mp4?t=1737512507","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090956/movie_max.mp4?t=1737512507"},"name":"Pre-Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257090956/7bec43388c929b10477acaad19054049a7ca80a7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737512507","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090956/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1737512507","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090956/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1737512507"}}],"name":"Dunderbeck","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 and Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":true,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["RUST LTD."],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477750/ss_bbdc803e0902b472d2228b95d40e150279cc876d.1920